    "val": "Planned Development Stage 2 and Tentative Parcel Map for Parcels 1 and 3 of Tract 8663, and a Site Development Review (SDR) Permit for Phase 1A of Parcel 1 of Tract 8663. The Planned Development Stage 2 would establish development regulations and architectural and landscape standards for Parcels 1 and 3. The Tentative Parcel Map would subdivide Parcel 1 into 13 parcels and Parcel 3 into two parcels. The Site Development Review Permit would allow development of Phase 1A on a portion of Parcel 1, consisting of a neighborhood retail shopping center with approximately 49,000 square feet of commercial space, including a new bank, retail tenants, and restaurant uses.",
